Would you just shut up?

253
00:13:34,374 --> 00:13:35,431
Who says that out loud?

254
00:13:35,514 --> 00:13:38,971
I mean, no matter which way you look
at it, pretending seems natural!

255
00:13:39,054 --> 00:13:39,884
Stop! No!

256
00:13:39,974 --> 00:13:42,711
I don't want people thinking
I'm in a relationship with you!

257
00:13:42,794 --> 00:13:45,711
Hey, now, don't say that
you're gonna hurt my feelings!

258
00:13:45,794 --> 00:13:46,624
Uh...

259
00:13:46,707 --> 00:13:50,651
You really feel hurt? Why
is that? Uh... Uh... Well...

260
00:13:50,734 --> 00:13:54,087
I didn't mean anything weird,
if that's what you thought.

261
00:13:55,374 --> 00:13:56,434
Wait, what?

262
00:13:56,714 --> 00:13:57,574
It can't be.

263
00:13:58,114 --> 00:14:00,611
So the man is looking after
her like a father might,

264
00:14:00,694 --> 00:14:03,331
but now the daughter has developed
romantic feelings for him?

265
00:14:03,414 --> 00:14:05,767
Is that the trope we're going with here?

266
00:14:07,234 --> 00:14:09,134
I've seen it in light novels.

267
00:14:09,714 --> 00:14:12,611
Those two must have overcome
so many obstacles together.

268
00:14:12,694 --> 00:14:14,291
They've lost their homelands.

269
00:14:14,374 --> 00:14:15,794
Their parents have died.

270
00:14:16,114 --> 00:14:19,251
Now their lives are saved and their
frozen hearts have begun to melt.

271
00:14:19,334 --> 00:14:20,171
And then...

272
00:14:20,254 --> 00:14:21,131
Uh...

273
00:14:21,214 --> 00:14:25,754
But in that case, I don't know why
Watanabe would deny his romantic feelings.

274
00:14:26,974 --> 00:14:27,914
Could it be?

275
00:14:28,354 --> 00:14:31,231
Have you left a fiancé behind
in the other world or something?

276
00:14:31,314 --> 00:14:35,551
It's possible a capable
professional guy like

277
00:14:35,634 --> 00:14:37,391
this there's no way he
doesn't have a girlfriend.

278
00:14:37,474 --> 00:14:39,711
I have a feeling Watanabe
will disappear without

279
00:14:39,794 --> 00:14:42,265
a word once their journey comes to an end.

280
00:14:42,814 --> 00:14:48,094
And when she realizes that Audrey
is the one who will be hurt?

281
00:14:51,214 --> 00:14:56,814
For her sake there is only one course
of action I can take kind father.

282
00:14:59,874 --> 00:15:01,791
Hang on, I am not her father.

283
00:15:01,874 --> 00:15:03,151
Please, I understand everything.

284
00:15:03,234 --> 00:15:06,511
So now allow me to call you father-in-law.

285
00:15:06,594 --> 00:15:08,931
No, you actually understand nothing.

286
00:15:09,014 --> 00:15:12,151
I'm a firm believer that people
who are unrelated by blood

287
00:15:12,234 --> 00:15:14,671
can still have an excellent
parent-child relationship.

288
00:15:14,754 --> 00:15:19,151
I agree with you on that point, but still
confused about why you'd mention it now?

289
00:15:19,234 --> 00:15:20,511
You're an excellent father.

290
00:15:20,594 --> 00:15:22,311
I know what you must be thinking?

291
00:15:22,394 --> 00:15:26,335
Can a man who's obviously weaker
than me still protect my daughter?

292
00:15:26,814 --> 00:15:28,990
Oh, you've been charmed, haven't you?

293
00:15:29,294 --> 00:15:30,882
I don't know what you mean.

294
00:15:31,074 --> 00:15:33,780
I've finally found an
opponent worthy of this.

295
00:15:34,594 --> 00:15:36,534
I challenge you, Watanabe!

296
00:15:36,814 --> 00:15:41,461
And know this, I'm going to surpass you
easily and take Audrey for my very own!

297
00:15:41,734 --> 00:15:42,874
Who's Audrey again?

298
00:15:43,174 --> 00:15:44,014
You are.

299
00:15:44,534 --> 00:15:46,994
Cry out my holy sword, Gram!

300
00:15:47,674 --> 00:15:48,504
Gram?

301
00:15:48,587 --> 00:15:50,491
Like the magic sword in Norse mythology?

302
00:15:50,574 --> 00:15:55,339
I thought there were tales that it cursed
its wielder to death, but he said holy.

303
00:15:55,614 --> 00:15:57,591
Look, just let the poor guy have this one.

304
00:15:57,674 --> 00:15:59,151
That's the holy sword, Gram.

305
00:15:59,234 --> 00:16:00,554
It makes him happy.

306
00:16:12,814 --> 00:16:14,154
Are you kidding?

307
00:16:14,314 --> 00:16:16,074
That sword is insanely sharp!

308
00:16:16,994 --> 00:16:18,054
It's off-putting.

309
00:16:18,214 --> 00:16:19,371
And if we hadn't dodged,

310
00:16:19,454 --> 00:16:21,911
our heads would have been doing
that same little slidey thing.

311
00:16:21,994 --> 00:16:23,935
Our opponent seems quite serious.

312
00:16:24,994 --> 00:16:26,582
So you can dodge that, huh?

313
00:16:26,934 --> 00:16:29,114
I'd expect no less, dear father.

314
00:16:29,474 --> 00:16:33,231
He's got some nerve saying that when
he came gunning to kill the noobies!

315
00:16:33,314 --> 00:16:34,434
That was close!

316
00:16:34,874 --> 00:16:37,351
I've never used it before
in that cutting power!

317
00:16:37,434 --> 00:16:41,091
Broken out into a cold sweat, I
almost cut Audrey right in half!

318
00:16:41,174 --> 00:16:43,751
I never imagined it was
something of this caliber.

319
00:16:43,834 --> 00:16:46,246
At this rate, I'll destroy my whole town!

320
00:16:46,354 --> 00:16:50,766
Is there any way I can avoid a fight
and still convince father to trust me?

321
00:16:52,694 --> 00:16:54,454
I can't hold myself back.

322
00:16:54,774 --> 00:16:57,371
It's been so long since
I've felt this excited.

323
00:16:57,454 --> 00:16:58,874
My dark powers dominate.

324
00:16:59,814 --> 00:17:02,294
So, I suppose it's time now...

325
00:17:02,934 --> 00:17:04,214
to get serious.

326
00:17:04,734 --> 00:17:07,271
I'll make them think I've got
more than this and threaten them!

327
00:17:07,354 --> 00:17:08,491
This is all I've got!

328
00:17:08,574 --> 00:17:09,491
Please buy into it!

329
00:17:09,574 --> 00:17:11,280
I'm begging you, just buy it!

330
00:17:11,474 --> 00:17:13,768
You mean that wasn't you being serious?

331
00:17:14,074 --> 00:17:16,694
There it is! Thank you,
Audrey! I love you!

332
00:17:17,234 --> 00:17:18,971
That wasn't serious at all.

333
00:17:19,054 --> 00:17:20,334
It's all right.

334
00:17:20,534 --> 00:17:23,181
Come, why not show me
what Sirius looks like?

335
00:17:24,894 --> 00:17:26,454
There's no going back now!

336
00:17:26,794 --> 00:17:28,034
I have to do it!

337
00:17:28,214 --> 00:17:29,114
Here I come!

338
00:17:29,354 --> 00:17:30,825
Prepare yourself, father!

339
00:17:32,074 --> 00:17:34,934
This is my single Sirius blow! Receive it!

340
00:17:35,054 --> 00:17:37,525
Oh, please don't give me that, receive it.

341
00:17:38,274 --> 00:17:39,980
I've apprehended the suspect.

342
00:17:40,274 --> 00:17:43,131
Oh, arrest the two that are
stuck in the ground as well.

343
00:17:43,214 --> 00:17:45,194
Wait, who are you? What is this?

344
00:17:45,574 --> 00:17:49,151
We are the neighborhood watch for
this town in the Merix territory.

345
00:17:49,234 --> 00:17:53,058
I'm arresting you under suspicion
of the destruction of buildings

346
00:18:05,934 --> 00:18:08,514
Thanks for your cooperation not at all.

347
00:18:08,654 --> 00:18:10,125
I only did what was right

348
00:18:12,614 --> 00:18:17,934
Well, then what else you two
will be important witnesses

349
00:18:18,574 --> 00:18:21,031
Would you accompany me
to our command post?

350
00:18:21,114 --> 00:18:21,944
Willingly?

351
00:18:22,294 --> 00:18:23,124
We'll go.

352
00:18:24,334 --> 00:18:25,674
I'm telling you!

353
00:18:25,874 --> 00:18:28,631
I am a hero who's been summoned
here to save this world!

354
00:18:28,714 --> 00:18:30,067
You have to believe me!

355
00:18:30,454 --> 00:18:34,031
Listen, do you have any idea how
many of those we've had this year?

356
00:18:34,114 --> 00:18:35,551
This is a false name, right?

357
00:18:35,634 --> 00:18:37,391
No, it's not a false name.

358
00:18:37,474 --> 00:18:38,574
It's my soul name.

359
00:18:38,854 --> 00:18:41,831
So it's that part of you
that's causing these problems?

360
00:18:41,914 --> 00:18:45,502
Heroes and such are nothing more
than hopeful rumors, anyway.

361
00:18:45,794 --> 00:18:46,624
Rumors?

362
00:18:46,894 --> 00:18:47,724
Yes.

363
00:18:47,807 --> 00:18:51,791
Rumors about oracles saying things
like the lord of evil will rise again,

364
00:18:51,874 --> 00:18:55,168
and that goddesses will call
forth heroes to fight back.

365
00:18:55,354 --> 00:18:57,114
Lord of evil? Goddesses?

366
00:18:57,334 --> 00:18:58,954
There's more like that one?

367
00:18:59,414 --> 00:19:01,014
But I'm the real thing!

368
00:19:01,214 --> 00:19:03,155
I promise you have to believe me!

369
00:19:03,494 --> 00:19:04,612
Alright, fine then.

370
00:19:04,974 --> 00:19:06,651
Can you prove that you're a hero?

371
00:19:06,734 --> 00:19:07,851
Oh, right! Proof?

372
00:19:07,934 --> 00:19:10,014
I actually have that! How's this?

373
00:19:10,614 --> 00:19:11,474
What is that?

374
00:19:11,774 --> 00:19:14,691
This is the proof which the
goddess has bestowed upon me.

375
00:19:14,774 --> 00:19:16,833
Or something like that, apparently.

376
00:19:20,374 --> 00:19:23,903
Indeed, it does seem to be the
seal of the goddess of night.

377
00:19:24,094 --> 00:19:25,391
Huh, what do you think of that?

378
00:19:25,474 --> 00:19:29,811
It should prove once and for all that
I am a hero summoned here by a goddess.

379
00:19:29,894 --> 00:19:31,411
Which means that you...

380
00:19:31,494 --> 00:19:32,894
committed perjury!

381
00:19:34,954 --> 00:19:37,354
Crime upon crime, you poor fool.

382
00:19:37,874 --> 00:19:40,871
Forging the seal of a goddess
is forbidden under the covenant.

383
00:19:40,954 --> 00:19:41,911
Can you stop it?

384
00:19:41,994 --> 00:19:42,824
This is the real thing!

385
00:19:42,907 --> 00:19:45,756
So the goddesses all have
some kind of seal, huh?

386
00:19:46,374 --> 00:19:48,431
Do you think maybe I've got one too?

387
00:19:48,514 --> 00:19:50,571
It doesn't seem like
it from what I can see.

388
00:19:50,654 --> 00:19:52,651
I don't remember seeing anything like that

389
00:19:52,734 --> 00:19:55,671
when I took a bath either
Maybe it's in a place.

390
00:19:55,754 --> 00:19:57,048
I wouldn't usually see

391
00:19:57,894 --> 00:19:59,174
What about my back?

392
00:20:01,494 --> 00:20:02,729
Can you see anything?

393
00:20:03,194 --> 00:20:05,554
Well, come on is it there or not?

394
00:20:05,814 --> 00:20:06,894
My underarms?

395
00:20:07,254 --> 00:20:08,354
Oh, maybe my butt.

396
00:20:08,794 --> 00:20:09,734
This sucks.

397
00:20:11,294 --> 00:20:12,124
What's wrong?

398
00:20:12,207 --> 00:20:16,451
Sorry, I tried to hold back a nosebleed
but it came out of my mouth instead.

399
00:20:16,534 --> 00:20:19,554
Is it even possible to
hold back a nosebleed?

400
00:20:24,794 --> 00:20:27,591
Quite lively in here today, my lord.

401
00:20:27,674 --> 00:20:30,731
Lord, what do I owe the honor?

402
00:20:30,814 --> 00:20:32,491
Well, I heard a rumor going around.

403
00:20:32,574 --> 00:20:36,691
That there was someone strong enough to
cut down a building with a single strike.

404
00:20:36,774 --> 00:20:38,598
Are you the person in question?

405
00:20:39,414 --> 00:20:43,151
His treatment seems pretty harsh for
the amount of damage he's caused.

406
00:20:43,234 --> 00:20:44,314
Come now, Lucius.

407
00:20:44,414 --> 00:20:45,244
He's fine.

408
00:20:45,327 --> 00:20:46,623
No one was hurt after all.

409
00:20:46,854 --> 00:20:47,684
Really?

410
00:20:47,767 --> 00:20:48,597
No one was hurt?

411
00:20:48,794 --> 00:20:49,754
What a relief.

412
00:20:50,294 --> 00:20:53,951
Lack of casualties aside, there is
no defense on the matter of the seal.

413
00:20:54,034 --> 00:20:57,622
Trying to pass himself off as
a priest, in short, is perjury.

414
00:20:58,774 --> 00:21:00,074
Huh. I see.

415
00:21:00,534 --> 00:21:03,534
But in the case that the
seal is authentic, then...

416
00:21:04,254 --> 00:21:07,901
It means that this man simply
needs to prove that he's a hero.

417
00:21:08,234 --> 00:21:09,474
How would he do that?

418
00:21:09,974 --> 00:21:11,334
Well, let us see.

419
00:21:11,594 --> 00:21:14,971
A hero who would save the world
would naturally be very strong.

420
00:21:15,054 --> 00:21:17,591
We'll have him show us
his abilities as a hero.

421
00:21:17,674 --> 00:21:19,011
Does that sound good to you?

422
00:21:19,094 --> 00:21:19,971
Yeah, let's do it.

423
00:21:20,054 --> 00:21:21,760
You replied much too quickly.

424
00:21:21,854 --> 00:21:23,951
It's odd for me to be the one to say it,

425
00:21:24,034 --> 00:21:26,740
but shouldn't you listen
to the details first?

426
00:21:26,894 --> 00:21:27,724
Wow.

427
00:21:27,807 --> 00:21:30,651
To think I'd so quickly find an
opportunity to show my true strength.

428
00:21:30,734 --> 00:21:32,831
So you're the type who
doesn't listen to others.

429
00:21:32,914 --> 00:21:35,194
Jinguji, what is this? Oh.

430
00:21:35,694 --> 00:21:39,047
A mission-based quest like
you get in games all the time!

431
00:21:39,494 --> 00:21:40,634
So they do exist?

432
00:21:40,934 --> 00:21:43,034
Yes, it seems they really exist.

433
00:21:43,614 --> 00:21:46,151
The Merix territory is
a big distribution hub.

434
00:21:46,234 --> 00:21:47,711
A lot of goods move through here.

435
00:21:47,794 --> 00:21:52,214
So, of course, robbers often appear
along the nearby roads lying in wait.

436
00:21:56,834 --> 00:22:00,511
Stop the living armor that's been
stealing our people's magical items.

437
00:22:00,594 --> 00:22:02,934
That is my request of you!

438
00:22:58,274 --> 00:23:00,414
I love you, I love you.

439
00:23:05,894 --> 00:23:08,611
Thank you

440
00:23:08,694 --> 00:23:15,694
so

441
00:23:18,774 --> 00:23:19,604
much.

442
00:23:36,254 --> 00:23:39,051
My name is what is he
doing trying to make his

443
00:23:39,134 --> 00:23:41,811
awful name sound cool I
think he puts in the work No

444
00:23:41,894 --> 00:23:45,931
matter what admirable wait
he smiled do you think

445
00:23:46,014 --> 00:23:49,194
he heard you compliment
him oh for sure no Question
